    "## 4. Phase 3: Text Sanitization & Boilerplate Excision\n",
    "Corporate compliance statements (Equal Employment Opportunity / Affirmative Action), applicant tracking system (ATS) tags, recruiter contact details, and hyperlinked navigation URLs introduce high-frequency co-occurrence patterns that severely distort unsupervised topic models. The cleaning module strips non-task text while preserving domain vocabulary.\n"
   ]
  },
