    "## 5. Phase 4: Cohort Harmonization, 1:1 Balancing & Deduplication\n",
    "To prevent unobserved platform growth from distorting diachronic shifts, cohorts are balanced 1:1 via random downsampling. Deduplication combines MD5 hash matching on full text with a 200-character prefix collision test to prune syndicated postings.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
