    "Unstructured job descriptions undergo lemmatization using spaCy's statistical parsing model (`en_core_web_sm`). Grammatical stop words, punctuation, numbers, and single-letter tokens are excised, retaining substantive lexical forms (nouns, verbs, adjectives).\n"
